          <div class="spec">data-bs-toggle="tooltip" and a title: app.js has one handler for the whole page, so content loaded later needs no setup. HTML is allowed, and with no title it shows the hidden span after the element (reaction names, timetable descriptions) · .875rem, --bs-emphasis-color at 90%, radius base, max 12.5rem wide · label icons, truncated text and disabled controls, not essential information</div>
