      <div class="spec">.search-input: up to 32.5rem, form-control-lg, the clear button a 1.5rem --bs-gray-400 circle, --bs-gray-600 on hover · the tabs are .nav-tabs · .search-result-list: each result base top and bottom with a 2px --bs-border-color rule below, the image floated in a 10rem column (5.625rem on mobile), the name an h2 · people results (.search-result-stacked) put their details table under the photo on mobile, the name and buttons beside it</div>
