            <a class="message-preview p-2 d-block text-body text-decoration-none" href="#components"><b>Jo</b> · Thanks <span class="text-body-secondary small">read</span></a>
            <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action text-center" href="#components">All notifications <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
